{"id": "DfL_OfixOAm", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Luka Chuppi, parchhaaiyon mein: diya jalte hi woh phir se deewar pe chhupan-chhupai khelne aa jaata hai 🪔\n\nHar shaam maa diya jalaati hai, aur deewar pe uski parchhaai ke saath ek nanhi parchhaai khelti hai: chaadar ke peeche chhupti, hawai jahaaz bankar udti, maa ki kahaniyon ke haathi pe baithti.\nPhir woh uski god mein sir rakh ke so jaata hai… aur roshni mein ghul jaata hai. Ledge pe bas uski topi aur khilona jahaaz reh jaate hain 🤍\n\n🎵 Luka Chuppi · A.R. Rahman, Lata Mangeshkar · Rang De Basanti\n\n@arrahman @prasoonjoshilive \n\nYe unhe bhejo jinhe aaj bhi shaam ko kisi ka intezaar rehta hai 🤍\n\nLuka Chuppi | Luka Chuppi song | Luka Chuppi animation | Lata Mangeshkar A.R. Rahman | Rang De Basanti songs | maa beta emotional song | mother son song | sad Hindi song | shadow animation | animated music video | Hindi song animation\n\n#LukaChuppi #ARRahman #RangDeBasanti #Maa #ShadowPlay", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793511188, "like_count": 2413, "comment_count": 13, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1833104384381228a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.172, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNzsyUijpEJJTkQcGBbdzdgQoO59F0t8o6MZJQtj_8H9iHyCTHQdwqoKVE3V8OnMxC0rSF9avEp81GwhRjWX1SxVYB_-FtV7x4TD9k.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Adrplhe25LjFmve5eX8HWveLzy74kTk2F2k_ksrmxnss_6UOyRX7Oyd24TJzzDT2bFtlTZ0-6xCZYqmIgfkai2ww&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=wMh-5TZ_k-QQ7kNvwHmyhKM&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=XNBt31KH6Egf6RI-MHlwNA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSSQ3EdbwFrFgojq0Pa40VP7eliKEuvPUTsuOjc0VBgHw&oe=6AF4324B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "no